{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011Cg3Ph4AGtSqpP1gcv313e","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Ticket 10 is finished: all four checklist items are done and committed in four commits.\n\n1. **Page content comes only from state.** `createApp` now takes just `loadScaffold`; I removed the `index` option and the `IndexOptions` type. The index page's heading and badge label are now `heading` and `badgeLabel` in `AppState`, so they go out in the serialized state script. Their defaults are the old text. The page reads them as plain values, so the HTML it produces has the same shape as before. Tests that used to pass these through `createApp` now build `State({ heading, badgeLabel })` and render the page from source.\n2. **Paths outside the prefix.** These now get a new route, `NOT_FOUND_ROUTE` (`'/404'`, in `pages/routes.ts`), so they render the not-found page with a 404. Before, a request for `/list` outside the prefix rendered the real list page with a 404 status. I also made the prefix check stricter: a path like `/example-hydrationx` now counts as outside the prefix, where before it was read as under it.\n3. **`/index.html`.** Under the prefix it now maps to route `/`, so the nav marks the home link as current. I removed `/index.html` from `ROUTES`, since it is no longer a route of its own.\n4. **Tests.** Each change started with a failing test in `test/hydration.ts` (red, then green). Final runs all passed: `test:hydration` (126 tests, plus 17 in the listener test), `test:hydration-dev` (17), `npm test` (413), lint, both typechecks, and `test:e2e` (12).\n\nI updated `example-hydration/README.md` and re-ran `toc:hydration`, and added a note to `AGENTS.md` on the state-only rule and how routes are worked out. Notes for the next attempt are in `.nightralph/notes.md`, which is not committed.\n\nI left the existing test for the `reduce-fouce` opacity gate alone, because removing that gate belongs to a different ticket. A fresh worktree needs `npm run build` before `test:hydration` will run."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":349,"cache_read_input_tokens":85663,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":349},"output_tokens":681,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"7208cf7e-7e1e-427b-a63d-adbbbefaf5e7","uuid":"36e9d37a-7e89-441d-bea8-1c937806246b","timestamp":"2026-10-15T04:28:44.214Z","request_id":"req_011Cg3Ph3rB5VoP4PaSpTWXW"}
